# Two independent render errors are both reported.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (titel = "x", ycolumns = revenu)
---- expected
error[DS5004]: unknown render property `titel`
