error[DS1001]: unknown column `revenu`
  --> query:2:50
  |
2 | | render timechart with (titel = "x", ycolumns = revenu)
  |                                                  ^^^^^^ no column named `revenu` here
  |
  = help: a column with a similar name exists: `revenue`
